OL,3,GNEWSAAn uneasy peace ` how a week of
OL,4,Athe Drumcree parade dispute has
OL,5,Aunfolded
OL,6,
OL,7,FAll the ingredients of a typical
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland crisis have been in
OL,9,Fplace for the past week except for one
OL,10,F` violence.
OL,12,FA stand-off - over a proposed Orange
OL,13,FOrder parade in Portadown, opposed by
OL,14,Fnationalist residents of the Garvaghy
OL,15,FRoad - has lasted since Sunday morning.
OL,17,FVerbal clashes between politicians,
OL,18,Flate-night negotiations, appeals for
OL,19,Fcalm and a major security operation
OL,20,Fhave all been in the mix.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
